  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">

      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Robotics • STEM • Digital Fabrication • Electronics</div>

        <h1>Ahmad Abdullah</h1>

        <h2>Robotics, STEM & Fabrication Instructor</h2>

        <p>
          I design and deliver hands-on learning experiences that combine robotics,
          electronics, programming, digital fabrication, CAD, and engineering.
          My work helps learners move from ideas and digital designs to physical
          prototypes through practical projects, experimentation, troubleshooting,
          and problem solving.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#fabrication">View Fabrication Projects</a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#robotics">View Robotics Projects</a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#contact">Contact Me</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-photo-card">
        <!-- ADD YOUR PHOTO HERE -->
        <img src="assets/ahmad-abdullah.jpg"
             alt="Ahmad Abdullah - Robotics, STEM and Fabrication Instructor">
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- =========================
       ABOUT
       ========================= -->
  <section id="about">
    <div class="container about-grid">

      <div class="profile-box">
        <h3>About Ahmad</h3>

        <p>
          Robotics, STEM and technical educator focused on making learning practical
          through electronics, CAD, CNC, robotics, programming and project-based
          engineering.
        </p>

        <div class="profile-tags">
          <span class="profile-tag">Digital Fabrication</span>
          <span class="profile-tag">Arduino</span>
          <span class="profile-tag">Robotics</span>
          <span class="profile-tag">Electronics</span>
          <span class="profile-tag">CAD</span>
          <span class="profile-tag">STEM Training</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-text">

        <p>
          I am a STEM and technical educator with extensive experience combining
          engineering, coding, electronics, robotics, mathematics, and hands-on
          project learning.
        </p>

        <p>
          My practical work includes Arduino and ESP32/ESP8266 systems, sensors,
          motors, robotics, CNC machines, laser fabrication, CAD and 3D design,
          electronics assembly, soldering, PCB design, IoT, and technical
          prototyping.
        </p>

        <p>
          I believe learners develop strong technical skills when they build,
          test, troubleshoot, improve, and present real projects. My training
          approach therefore combines clear instruction with guided practice,
          experimentation, and project-based learning.
        </p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- =========================
       EXPERTISE
       ========================= -->
  <section id="expertise">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>What I Do</h2>
        <p>
          My work connects digital design, electronics, fabrication, robotics,
          programming and hands-on technical education.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="cards">

        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">⚙</div>
          <h3>Digital Fabrication</h3>
          <p>
            CNC, laser fabrication, CAD/3D design, prototyping, machine control,
            ESTLCAM, Inkscape/SVG and practical fabrication workflows.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">🤖</div>
          <h3>Robotics & Electronics</h3>
          <p>
            Arduino, ESP32/ESP8266, microcontrollers, sensors, motors, actuators,
            robotics kits, electronics, soldering and troubleshooting.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">💡</div>
          <h3>STEM & Technical Training</h3>
          <p>
            Project-based learning, curriculum development, learner mentoring,
            technical demonstrations, practical challenges and engineering design.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- =========================================================
       FABRICATION & ENGINEERING PROJECTS
       ADD YOUR OWN PHOTOS:
       Each project has a clearly marked image filename.
       Recommended: 1200 x 900 px or similar landscape photos.
       ========================================================= -->
  <section id="fabrication">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>Fabrication & Engineering Projects</h2>
        <p>
          Selected real-world work demonstrating machine building, CNC operation,
          CAD-to-part workflows, electronics integration, laser fabrication and measurement.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="project-grid">

        <!-- PROJECT 1 -->
        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="project-image">
            <!-- ADD PHOTO: assets/cnc-machine.jpg
                 Show the complete CNC machine. -->
            <img src="assets/cnc-machine.jpg" alt="Arduino-controlled CNC machine built by Ahmad Abdullah">
          </div>
          <div class="project-body">
            <h3>Arduino-Controlled CNC Machine</h3>
            <p>
              Built and successfully operated a CNC machine using Arduino Nano,
              3 N·m motors, motor drivers and ESTLCAM. The project involved
              machine integration, motion control, configuration, testing and
              practical machining.
            </p>
            <div class="tags">
              <span class="tag">CNC</span>
              <span class="tag">Arduino Nano</span>
              <span class="tag">ESTLCAM</span>
              <span class="tag">Motors</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- PROJECT 2 -->
        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="project-image">
            <!-- ADD PHOTO: assets/laser-cnc.jpg
                 Show the laser CNC machine and, if possible, a working result. -->
            <img src="assets/laser-cnc-machine.jpg" alt="Laser CNC fabrication machine">
          </div>
          <div class="project-body">
            <h3>Laser CNC Machine</h3>
            <p>
              Built a functional laser CNC machine for a client, gaining practical
              experience with laser modules, motion control, machine integration,
              configuration and troubleshooting.
            </p>
            <div class="tags">
              <span class="tag">Laser</span>
              <span class="tag">CNC</span>
              <span class="tag">Motion Control</span>
              <span class="tag">Fabrication</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- PROJECT 3 -->
        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="project-image">
            <!-- ADD PHOTO: assets/cad-design.jpg
                 Show a Fusion 360 / Inventor / AutoCAD model. -->
            <img src="assets/cad-to-part.jpg" alt="CAD design compared with manufactured part">
          </div>
          <div class="project-body">
            <h3>CAD & 3D Design</h3>
            <p>
              Practical experience creating technical drawings, component designs and
              fabrication-ready layouts using AutoCAD, Fusion 360, Autodesk Inventor and Tinkercad.
            </p>
            <div class="tags">
              <span class="tag">Fusion 360</span>
              <span class="tag">Inventor</span>
              <span class="tag">AutoCAD</span>
              <span class="tag">Tinkercad</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- PROJECT 4 -->
        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="project-image">
            <!-- ADD PHOTO: assets/electronics-pcb.jpg
                 Show a PCB, electronics prototype, soldering or circuit. -->
            <img src="assets/cnc-control-electronics.jpg" alt="CNC control electronics and stepper drivers">
          </div>
          <div class="project-body">
            <h3>Electronics & PCB Prototyping</h3>
            <p>
              Designed circuits and PCBs using Proteus and Eagle and developed
              practical electronics prototypes involving wiring, soldering,
              sensors, motors and microcontrollers.
            </p>
            <div class="tags">
              <span class="tag">PCB</span>
              <span class="tag">Proteus</span>
              <span class="tag">Eagle</span>
              <span class="tag">Soldering</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- PROJECT 5 -->
        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="project-image">
            <!-- ADD PHOTO: assets/rc-aircraft.jpg
                 Show one of your RC aircraft. -->
            <img src="assets/rc-aircraft.jpg" alt="RC aircraft built by Ahmad Abdullah">
          </div>
          <div class="project-body">
            <h3>RC Aircraft & Electromechanical Systems</h3>
            <p>
              Built RC aircraft using servos, brushless motors and FlySky radio
              control systems, developing practical experience with motors,
              control systems and mechanical integration.
            </p>
            <div class="tags">
              <span class="tag">RC</span>
              <span class="tag">Brushless Motors</span>
              <span class="tag">Servos</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- PROJECT 6 -->
        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="project-image">
            <img src="assets/windmill.png" alt="Vertical-axis windmill prototype built by Ahmad Abdullah">
          </div>
          <div class="project-body">
            <h3>Vertical-Axis Windmill</h3>
            <p>
              Designed and built a vertical-axis windmill as a practical
              electromechanical project combining mechanical construction,
              energy concepts and prototyping.
            </p>
            <div class="tags">
              <span class="tag">Mechanical</span>
              <span class="tag">Energy</span>
              <span class="tag">Prototyping</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- PROJECT 7 -->
        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="project-image">
            <img src="assets/robotic-arm.jpg" alt="3D-printed robotic arm prototype built by Ahmad Abdullah">
          </div>
          <div class="project-body">
            <h3>3D-Printed Robotic Arm Prototype</h3>
            <p>
              Developed a functional robotic arm prototype using 3D-printed mechanical
              components, geared joints and servo motors. The project demonstrates
              hands-on mechanical prototyping, assembly and the integration of digital
              fabrication with robotics and motion control.
            </p>
            <div class="tags">
              <span class="tag">3D Printing</span>
              <span class="tag">Mechanical Design</span>
              <span class="tag">Servo Motors</span>
              <span class="tag">Robotics</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="project-image">
            <img src="assets/cnc-software-toolpath.jpg" alt="ESTLCAM CNC toolpath and controller interface">
          </div>
          <div class="project-body">
            <h3>CNC Toolpaths & Machine Control</h3>
            <p>
              Generated and executed CNC toolpaths using ESTLCAM, working with
              feed rates, spindle speed, coordinates, G-code and machine control.
            </p>
            <div class="tags">
              <span class="tag">ESTLCAM</span>
              <span class="tag">G-code</span>
              <span class="tag">Toolpaths</span>
              <span class="tag">CNC Control</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="project-image">
            <img src="assets/digital-fabrication-overview.jpg" alt="Digital fabrication overview">
          </div>
          <div class="project-body">
            <h3>Digital Fabrication Workflow</h3>
            <p>
              From CAD design and measurement to machine setup, CNC fabrication,
              laser work and finished physical prototypes.
            </p>
            <div class="tags">
              <span class="tag">CAD</span>
              <span class="tag">CNC</span>
              <span class="tag">Laser</span>
